  NestBuildingBar: {fileID: 2358945062960898415}
  FarmlandBuildingBar: {fileID: 8028514760392528929}
  GoldenCornBuildingBar: {fileID: 2616796819425573954}
  PlaygroundBuildingBar: {fileID: 1262981699660195658}
  CompostsiteBuildingBar: {fileID: 2891286188473471329}
  SecreteSiteBuildingBar: {fileID: 7390111312441536824}
  HammerSawBuildingBar: {fileID: 4203161712232629941}
  StrawCraftBuildingBar: {fileID: 7623676468376536709}
  AltarBuildingBar: {fileID: 7672281964391082819}
  DrumBuildingBar: {fileID: 6894245550759001135}
  lockedString: ????????????????????? ????????Locked???????? ???????????????????????
  NestDescription: 'Nest: spawn eggs here, hutch kid ducks after a few moments. 
    Cost: $15 ($5 + 5 * $2), total $15; foundation costs $5; requires 5 times to
    build, each costs $2 . Unlocking Condition: Build 1 Farmland.'
  FarmlandDescription: 'Farmland: grow some crops, ducks can collect them when harvest,
    or water them when not. Cost: $30 ($6 + 8 * $3), total $30; foundation costs
    $6; requires 8 times to build, each costs $3. Unlocking Condition: Collect 10
    crumbies from the grass!'
  GoldenCornDescription: 'Golden Corn: the ducks will go straight to the nearest
    farm or grass when touching it or when the horn blows. Cost: $40 ($10 + 10 *
    $3), total $40; foundation costs $10; requires 10 times to build, each costs
    $3. Unlocking Condition: Build 2 farmlands.'
  PlaygroundDescription: 'Playground: a playground could improve the happiness of
    the duck collided. Cost: $26 ($20 + 2 * $3), total $26; foundation costs $20;
    requires 10 times to build, each costs $3. Unlocking Condition: Have 5 ducks.'
  CompostsiteDescription: 'Compost Site: when there are poops inside, every farm
    or grass within its range will produce more crumbies. Cost: $60 ($12 + 12 * $4),
    total $60; foundation costs $12; requires 12 times to build, each costs $4. Unlock
    Condition: Build 3 Farmland.'
  SecreteSiteDescription: 'Mr Duckson''s Secret Site: can store crumbies here. After
    a few moments, it will return the ducks with more crumbies. Cost: Cost:$100 ($25
    + 15 * $5), total $100; foundation costs $25; requires 15 times to build, each
    costs $5. Unlock Condition: Collect 300 crumbies from all sources.'
  HammerSawDescription: 'Hammer & Saw Symmbol: the ducks will go straight to the
    nearest construction site when touching it. Cost: $40 ($10 + 10 * $3), total
    $40; foundation costs $10; requires 10 times to build, each costs $3. Unlock
    Condition: Build 3 buildings in total.'
  StrawCraftDescription: 'Straw Craft: the duck will be forced to labor in it for
    a few moments, not able to get away, but will produce some crumbies when finished.
    Cost: $30 ($6 + 8 * $3), total $30; foundation costs $6; requires 8 times to
    build, each costs $3. Unlock Condition: Collect 30 crumbies from Farmland in
    total.'
  AltarDescription: 'Altar: sacrifice one duck to produce more crumbies. Cost: $10
    ($2 + 2 * $4), total $10; foundation costs $2; requires 2 times to build, each
    costs $4. Unlock Condition: Have 6 ducks.'
  DrumDescription: 'Duck duck Drum: speed up the ducks that collide with it or when
    the drum roars. Cost: $50 ($10 + 10 * $4), total $50; foundation costs $10; requires
    10 times to build, each costs $4. Unlock Condition: ducks collide buildings 20
    times in total.'
